{"translator":"zhouyi","edition":"周易 (Zhou Yi) — Classical Chinese canonical text.","sourceUrl":"https://ctext.org/book-of-changes","licenseNote":"Zhou Yi (周易) is in the public domain. Cross-verified 1:1 against the Chinese Text Project (ctext.org) to ensure canonical accuracy.","generatedAt":"2026-05-11T02:22:21.276Z","hexagrams":[{"number":1,"name":"乾","chineseName":"乾","pinyin":"qián","upperTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","judgment":"元亨，利貞。","image":"天行健，君子以自強不息。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"潛龍，勿用。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"見龍在田，利見大人。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"君子終日乾乾，夕惕若，厲，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"或躍在淵，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"飛龍在天，利見大人。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"亢龍有悔。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"111111","yongJiu":"見群龍無首，吉。"},{"number":2,"name":"坤","chineseName":"坤","pinyin":"kūn","upperTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","judgment":"元亨，利牝馬之貞。君子有攸往，先迷後得主，利西南得朋，東北喪朋。安貞，吉。","image":"地勢坤，君子以厚德載物。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"履霜，堅冰至。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"直，方，大，不習無不利。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"含章可貞。或從王事，無成有終。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"括囊；無咎，無譽。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"黃裳，元吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"龍戰於野，其血玄黃。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"000000","yongLiu":"利永貞。"},{"number":3,"name":"屯","chineseName":"屯","pinyin":"zhūn","upperTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","lowerTrigram":"THE AROUSING","judgment":"元亨，利貞，勿用有攸往，利建侯。","image":"雲，雷，屯；君子以經綸。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"磐桓；利居貞，利建侯。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"屯如邅如，乘馬班如。匪寇婚媾，女子貞不字，十年乃字。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"即鹿無虞，惟入於林中，君子幾不如舍，往吝。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"乘馬班如，求婚媾，往吉，無不利。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"屯其膏，小貞吉，大貞兇。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"乘馬班如，泣血漣如。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"010001"},{"number":4,"name":"蒙","chineseName":"蒙","pinyin":"méng","upperTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","lowerTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","judgment":"亨。匪我求童蒙，童蒙求我。初筮告，再三瀆，瀆則不告。利貞。","image":"山下出泉，蒙；君子以果行育德。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"發蒙，利用刑人，用說桎梏，以往吝。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"包蒙吉；納婦吉；子克家。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"勿用娶女；見金夫，不有躬，無攸利。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"困蒙，吝。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"童蒙，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"擊蒙；不利為寇，利禦寇。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"100010"},{"number":5,"name":"需","chineseName":"需","pinyin":"xū","upperTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","lowerTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","judgment":"有孚，光亨，貞吉。利涉大川。","image":"雲上於天，需；君子以飲食宴樂。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"需於郊。利用恒，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"需於沙。小有言，終吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"需於泥，致寇至。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"需於血，出自穴。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"需於酒食，貞吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"入於穴，有不速之客三人來，敬之終吉。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"010111"},{"number":6,"name":"訟","chineseName":"訟","pinyin":"sòng","upperTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","judgment":"有孚，窒。惕中吉。終兇。利見大人，不利涉大川。","image":"天與水違行，訟；君子以作事謀始。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"不永所事，小有言，終吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"不克訟，歸而逋，其邑人三百戶，無眚。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"食舊德，貞厲，終吉，或從王事，無成。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"不克訟，復即命渝，安貞吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"訟元吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"或錫之鞶帶，終朝三褫之。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"111010"},{"number":7,"name":"師","chineseName":"師","pinyin":"shī","upperTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","judgment":"貞，丈人，吉無咎。","image":"地中有水，師；君子以容民畜眾。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"師出以律，否臧兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"在師中吉，無咎，王三錫命。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"師或輿屍，兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"師左次，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"田有禽，利執言，無咎。長子帥師，弟子輿屍，貞兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"大君有命，開國承家，小人勿用。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"000010"},{"number":8,"name":"比","chineseName":"比","pinyin":"bǐ","upperTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","lowerTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","judgment":"吉。原筮元永貞，無咎。不寧方來，後夫兇。","image":"地上有水，比；先王以建萬國，親諸侯。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"有孚，比之，無咎。有孚盈缶，終來有他，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"比之自內，貞吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"比之匪人。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"外比之，貞吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"顯比，王用三驅，失前禽。邑人不誡，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"比之無首，兇。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"010000"},{"number":9,"name":"小畜","chineseName":"小畜","pinyin":"xiǎochù","upperTrigram":"THE GENTLE","lowerTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","judgment":"亨。密雲不雨，自我西郊。","image":"風行天上，小畜；君子以懿文德。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"復自道，何其咎，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"牽復，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"輿說輻，夫妻反目。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"有孚，血去惕出，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"有孚攣如，富以其鄰。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"既雨既處，尚德載，婦貞厲。月幾望，君子征兇。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"110111"},{"number":10,"name":"履","chineseName":"履","pinyin":"lǚ","upperTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","judgment":"履虎尾，不咥人，亨。","image":"上天下澤，履；君子以辨上下，安民誌。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"素履，往無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"履道坦坦，幽人貞吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"眇能視，跛能履，履虎尾，咥人，兇。武人為於大君。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"履虎尾，訴訴，終吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"夬履，貞厲。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"視履考祥，其旋元吉。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"111011"},{"number":11,"name":"泰","chineseName":"泰","pinyin":"tài","upperTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","judgment":"小往大來，吉亨。","image":"天地交泰，後以財成天地之道，輔相天地之宜，以左右民。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"拔茅茹，以其彙，征吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"包荒，用馮河，不遐遺，朋亡，得尚於中行。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"無平不陂，無往不復，艱貞無咎。勿恤其孚，於食有福。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"翩翩，不富，以其鄰，不戒以孚。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"帝乙歸妹，以祉元吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"城復於隍，勿用師。自邑告命，貞吝。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"000111"},{"number":12,"name":"否","chineseName":"否","pinyin":"pǐ","upperTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","judgment":"否之匪人，不利君子貞，大往小來。","image":"天地不交，否；君子以儉德辟難，不可榮以祿。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"拔茅茹，以其匯，貞吉亨。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"包承。小人吉，大人否，亨。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"包羞。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"有命，無咎，疇離祉。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"休否，大人吉。其亡其亡，系於苞桑。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"傾否，先否後喜。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"111000"},{"number":13,"name":"同人","chineseName":"同人","pinyin":"tóngrén","upperTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE CLINGING","judgment":"同人於野，亨。利涉大川，利君子貞。","image":"天與火，同人；君子以類族辨物。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"同人於門，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"同人於宗，吝。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"伏戎於莽，升其高陵，三歲不興。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"乘其墉，弗克攻，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"同人，先號啕而後笑。大師克相遇。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"同人於郊，無悔。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"111101"},{"number":14,"name":"大有","chineseName":"大有","pinyin":"dàyǒu","upperTrigram":"THE CLINGING","lowerTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","judgment":"元亨。","image":"火在天上，大有；君子以遏惡揚善，順天休命。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"無交害，匪咎，艱則無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"同人於宗，吝。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"公用亨於天子，小人弗克。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"匪其彭，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"厥孚交如，威如；吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"自天佑之，吉無不利。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"101111"},{"number":15,"name":"謙","chineseName":"謙","pinyin":"qiān","upperTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","lowerTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","judgment":"亨，君子有終。","image":"地中有山，謙；君子以裒多益寡，稱物平施。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"謙謙君子，用涉大川，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"鳴謙，貞吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"勞謙，君子有終，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"無不利，撝謙。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"不富，以其鄰，利用侵伐，無不利。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"鳴謙，利用行師，征邑國。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"000100"},{"number":16,"name":"豫","chineseName":"豫","pinyin":"yù","upperTrigram":"THE AROUSING","lowerTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","judgment":"利建侯，行師。","image":"雷出地奮，豫。先王以作樂崇德，殷薦之上帝，以配祖考。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"鳴豫，兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"介於石，不終日，貞吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"盱豫，悔。遲有悔。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"由豫，大有得。勿疑。朋盍簪。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"貞疾，恒不死。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"冥豫，成有渝，無咎。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"001000"},{"number":17,"name":"隨","chineseName":"隨","pinyin":"suí","upperTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","lowerTrigram":"THE AROUSING","judgment":"元亨利貞，無咎。","image":"澤中有雷，隨；君子以向晦入宴息。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"官有渝，貞吉。出門交有功。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"系小子，失丈夫。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"系丈夫，失小子。隨有求得，利居貞。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"隨有獲，貞兇。有孚在道，以明，何咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"孚於嘉，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"拘系之，乃從維之。王用亨於西山。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"011001"},{"number":18,"name":"蠱","chineseName":"蠱","pinyin":"gǔ","upperTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","lowerTrigram":"THE GENTLE","judgment":"元亨，利涉大川。先甲三日，後甲三日。","image":"山下有風，蠱；君子以振民育德。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"幹父之蠱，有子，考無咎，厲終吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"幹母之蠱，不可貞。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"幹父之蠱，小有悔，無大咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"裕父之蠱，往見吝。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"幹父之蠱，用譽。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"不事王侯，高尚其事。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"100110"},{"number":19,"name":"臨","chineseName":"臨","pinyin":"lín","upperTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","judgment":"元，亨，利，貞。至於八月有兇。","image":"澤上有地，臨；君子以教思無窮，容保民無疆。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"鹹臨，貞吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"鹹臨，吉無不利。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"甘臨，無攸利。既憂之，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"至臨，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"知臨，大君之宜，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"敦臨，吉無咎。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"000011"},{"number":20,"name":"觀","chineseName":"觀","pinyin":"guān","upperTrigram":"THE GENTLE","lowerTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","judgment":"盥而不薦，有孚顒若。","image":"風行地上，觀；先王以省方，觀民設教。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"童觀，小人無咎，君子吝。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"窺觀，利女貞。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"觀我生，進退。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"觀國之光，利用賓於王。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"觀我生，君子無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"觀其生，君子無咎。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"110000"},{"number":21,"name":"噬嗑","chineseName":"噬嗑","pinyin":"shìkè","upperTrigram":"THE CLINGING","lowerTrigram":"THE AROUSING","judgment":"亨。利用獄。","image":"雷電噬嗑；先王以明罰敕法。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"屨校滅趾，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"噬膚滅鼻，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"噬臘肉，遇毒；小吝，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"噬乾胏，得金矢，利艱貞，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"噬乾肉，得黃金，貞厲，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"何校滅耳，兇。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"101001"},{"number":22,"name":"賁","chineseName":"賁","pinyin":"bì","upperTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","lowerTrigram":"THE CLINGING","judgment":"亨。小利有攸往。","image":"山下有火，賁；君子以明庶政，無敢折獄。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"賁其趾，舍車而徒。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"賁其須。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"賁如濡如，永貞吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"賁如皤如，白馬翰如，匪寇婚媾。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"賁於丘園，束帛戔戔，吝，終吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"白賁，無咎。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"100101"},{"number":23,"name":"剝","chineseName":"剝","pinyin":"bō","upperTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","lowerTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","judgment":"不利有攸往。","image":"山附地上，剝；上以厚下，安宅。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"剝床以足，蔑貞兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"剝床以辨，蔑貞兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"剝之，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"剝床以膚，兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"貫魚，以宮人寵，無不利。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"碩果不食，君子得輿，小人剝廬。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"100000"},{"number":24,"name":"復","chineseName":"復","pinyin":"fù","upperTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE AROUSING","judgment":"亨。出入無疾，朋來無咎。反復其道，七日來復，利有攸往。","image":"雷在地中，復；先王以至日閉關，商旅不行，後不省方。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"不復遠，無祗悔，元吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"休復，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"頻復，厲無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"中行獨復。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"敦復，無悔。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"迷復，兇，有災眚。用行師，終有大敗，以其國君，兇；至於十年，不克征。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"000001"},{"number":25,"name":"無妄","chineseName":"無妄","pinyin":"wúwàng","upperTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE AROUSING","judgment":"元亨，利貞。其匪正有眚，不利有攸往。","image":"天下雷行，物與無妄；先王以茂對時，育萬物。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"無妄，往吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"不耕獲，不災畬，則利有攸往。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"無妄之災，或系之牛，行人之得，邑人之災。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"可貞，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"無妄之疾，勿藥有喜。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"無妄，行有眚，無攸利。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"111001"},{"number":26,"name":"大畜","chineseName":"大畜","pinyin":"dàchù","upperTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","lowerTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","judgment":"利貞，不家食吉，利涉大川。","image":"天在山中，大畜；君子以多識前言往行，以畜其德。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"有厲利已。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"輿說輹。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"良馬逐，利艱貞。曰閑輿衛，利有攸往。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"童牛之牿，元吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"豶豕之牙，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"何天之衢，亨。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"100111"},{"number":27,"name":"頤","chineseName":"頤","pinyin":"yí","upperTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","lowerTrigram":"THE AROUSING","judgment":"貞吉。觀頤，自求口實。","image":"山下有雷，頤；君子以慎言語，節飲食。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"舍爾靈龜，觀我朵頤，兇。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"顛頤，拂經，於丘頤，征兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"拂頤，貞兇，十年勿用，無攸利。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"顛頤，吉，虎視眈眈，其欲逐逐，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"拂經，居貞吉，不可涉大川。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"由頤，厲吉，利涉大川。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"100001"},{"number":28,"name":"大過","chineseName":"大過","pinyin":"dàguò","upperTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","lowerTrigram":"THE GENTLE","judgment":"棟橈，利有攸往，亨。","image":"澤滅木，大過；君子以獨立不懼，遯世無悶。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"藉用白茅，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"枯楊生稊，老夫得其女妻，無不利。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"棟橈，兇。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"棟隆，吉；有它吝。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"枯楊生華，老婦得士夫，無咎無譽。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"過涉滅頂，兇，無咎。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"011110"},{"number":29,"name":"坎","chineseName":"坎","pinyin":"kǎn","upperTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","lowerTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","judgment":"習坎，有孚，維心亨，行有尚。","image":"水洊至，習坎；君子以常德行，習教事。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"習坎，入於坎窞，兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"坎有險，求小得。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"來之坎坎，險且枕，入於坎窞，勿用。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"樽酒簋貳，用缶，納約自牖，終無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"坎不盈，祗既平，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"系用徽纆，置於叢棘，三歲不得，兇。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"010010"},{"number":30,"name":"離","chineseName":"離","pinyin":"lí","upperTrigram":"THE CLINGING","lowerTrigram":"THE CLINGING","judgment":"利貞，亨。畜牝牛，吉。","image":"明兩作離，大人以繼明照於四方。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"履錯然，敬之無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"黃離，元吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"日昃之離，不鼓缶而歌，則大耋之嗟，兇。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"突如其來如，焚如，死如，棄如。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"出涕沱若，戚嗟若，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"王用出征，有嘉折首，獲匪其醜，無咎。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"101101"},{"number":31,"name":"鹹","chineseName":"咸","pinyin":"xián","upperTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","lowerTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","judgment":"鹹，亨，利貞，取女吉。","image":"山上有澤，鹹，君子以虛受人。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"，鹹其拇。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"，鹹其腓，兇，居吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"，鹹其股，執其隨，往吝。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"，貞吉，悔亡，憧憧往來，朋從爾思。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"，鹹其脢，無悔。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"，鹹其輔頰舌。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"011100"},{"number":32,"name":"恒","chineseName":"恆","pinyin":"héng","upperTrigram":"THE AROUSING","lowerTrigram":"THE GENTLE","judgment":"亨，無咎，利貞，利有攸往。","image":"雷風，恒；君子以立不易方。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"浚恒，貞兇，無攸利。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"悔亡。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"不恒其德，或承之羞，貞吝。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"田無禽。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"恒其德，貞，婦人吉，夫子兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"振恒，兇。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"001110"},{"number":33,"name":"遯","chineseName":"遁","pinyin":"dùn","upperTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","lowerTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","judgment":"亨，小利貞。","image":"天下有山，遯；君子以遠小人，不惡而嚴。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"遯尾，厲，勿用有攸往。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"執之用黃牛之革，莫之勝說。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"系遯，有疾厲，畜臣妾吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"好遯，君子吉，小人否。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"嘉遯，貞吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"肥遯，無不利。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"111100"},{"number":34,"name":"大壯","chineseName":"大壯","pinyin":"dàzhuàng","upperTrigram":"THE AROUSING","lowerTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","judgment":"利貞","image":"雷在天上，大壯；君子以非禮勿履。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"壯於趾，征兇，有孚。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"貞吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"小人用壯，君子用罔，貞厲。羝羊觸藩，羸其角。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"貞吉悔亡，藩決不羸，壯於大輿之輹。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"喪羊於易，無悔。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"羝羊觸藩，不能退，不能遂，無攸利，艱則吉。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"001111"},{"number":35,"name":"晉","chineseName":"晉","pinyin":"jìn","upperTrigram":"THE CLINGING","lowerTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","judgment":"康侯用錫馬蕃庶，晝日三接。","image":"明出地上，晉；君子以自昭明德。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"晉如，摧如，貞吉。罔孚，裕無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"晉如，愁如，貞吉。受茲介福，於其王母。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"眾允，悔亡。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"晉如碩鼠，貞厲。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"悔亡，失得勿恤，往吉，無不利。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"晉其角，維用伐邑，厲吉無咎，貞吝。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"101000"},{"number":36,"name":"明夷","chineseName":"明夷","pinyin":"míngyí","upperTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE CLINGING","judgment":"利艱貞。","image":"明入地中，明夷；君子以蒞眾，用晦而明。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"明夷於飛，垂其翼。君子於行，三日不食，有攸往，主人有言。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"明夷，夷於左股，用拯馬壯，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"明夷於南狩，得其大首，不可疾貞。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"入於左腹，獲明夷之心，出於門庭。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"箕子之明夷，利貞。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"不明晦，初登於天，後入於地。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"000101"},{"number":37,"name":"家人","chineseName":"家人","pinyin":"jiārén","upperTrigram":"THE GENTLE","lowerTrigram":"THE CLINGING","judgment":"利女貞。","image":"風自火出，家人；君子以言有物，而行有恒。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"閑有家，悔亡。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"無攸遂，在中饋，貞吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"家人嗃嗃，悔厲吉；婦子嘻嘻，終吝。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"富家，大吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"王假有家，勿恤，往吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"有孚威如，終吉。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"110101"},{"number":38,"name":"睽","chineseName":"睽","pinyin":"kuí","upperTrigram":"THE CLINGING","lowerTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","judgment":"小事吉。","image":"上火下澤，睽；君子以同而異。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"悔亡，喪馬勿逐，自復；見惡人無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"遇主於巷，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"見輿曳，其牛掣，其人天且劓，無初有終。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"睽孤，遇元夫，交孚，厲無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"悔亡，厥宗噬膚，往何咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"睽孤，見豕負塗，載鬼一車，先張之弧，後說之弧，匪寇婚媾，往遇雨則吉。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"101011"},{"number":39,"name":"蹇","chineseName":"蹇","pinyin":"jiǎn","upperTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","lowerTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","judgment":"利西南，不利東北；利見大人，貞吉。","image":"山上有水，蹇；君子以反身修德。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"往蹇，來譽。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"王臣蹇蹇，匪躬之故。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"往蹇來反。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"往蹇來連。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"大蹇朋來。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"往蹇來碩，吉；利見大人。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"010100"},{"number":40,"name":"解","chineseName":"解","pinyin":"xiè","upperTrigram":"THE AROUSING","lowerTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","judgment":"利西南，無所往，其來復吉。有攸往，夙吉。","image":"雷雨作，解；君子以赦過宥罪。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"田獲三狐，得黃矢，貞吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"負且乘，致寇至，貞吝。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"解而拇，朋至斯孚。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"君子維有解，吉；有孚於小人。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"公用射隼於高墉之上，獲之，無不利。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"001010"},{"number":41,"name":"損","chineseName":"損","pinyin":"sǔn","upperTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","lowerTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","judgment":"有孚，元吉，無咎，可貞，利有攸往。曷之用，二簋可用享。","image":"山下有澤，損；君子以懲忿窒欲。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"巳事遄往，無咎，酌損之。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"利貞，征兇，弗損，益之。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"三人行，則損一人；一人行，則得其友。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"損其疾，使遄有喜，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"或益之，十朋之龜弗克違，元吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"弗損益之，無咎，貞吉，有攸往，得臣無家。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"100011"},{"number":42,"name":"益","chineseName":"益","pinyin":"yì","upperTrigram":"THE GENTLE","lowerTrigram":"THE AROUSING","judgment":"利有攸往，利涉大川。","image":"風雷，益；君子以見善則遷，有過則改。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"利用為大作，元吉，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"或益之，十朋之龜弗克違，永貞吉。王用享於帝，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"益之用兇事，無咎。有孚中行，告公用圭。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"中行，告公從。利用為依遷國。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"有孚惠心，勿問元吉。有孚惠我德。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"莫益之，或擊之，立心勿恒，兇。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"110001"},{"number":43,"name":"夬","chineseName":"夬","pinyin":"guài","upperTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","lowerTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","judgment":"揚於王庭，孚號，有厲，告自邑，不利即戎，利有攸往。","image":"澤上於天，夬；君子以施祿及下，居德則忌。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"壯於前趾，往不勝為咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"惕號，莫夜有戎，勿恤。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"壯於頄，有兇。君子夬夬，獨行，遇雨，若濡，有慍，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"臀無膚，其行次且。牽羊悔亡，聞言不信。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"莧陸夬夬，中行無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"無號，終有兇。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"011111"},{"number":44,"name":"姤","chineseName":"姤","pinyin":"gòu","upperTrigram":"THE CREATIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE GENTLE","judgment":"女壯，勿用取女。","image":"天下有風，姤；後以施命誥四方。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"系於金柅，貞吉，有攸往，見兇，羸豕孚踟躅。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"包有魚，無咎，不利賓。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"臀無膚，其行次且，厲，無大咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"包無魚，起兇。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"以杞包瓜，含章，有隕自天。九五：以杞包瓜，含章，有隕自天。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"姤其角，吝，無咎。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"111110"},{"number":45,"name":"萃","chineseName":"萃","pinyin":"cuì","upperTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","lowerTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","judgment":"亨。王假有廟，利見大人，亨，利貞。用大牲吉，利有攸往。","image":"澤上於地，萃；君子以除戎器，戒不虞。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"有孚不終，乃亂乃萃，若號一握為笑，勿恤，往無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"引吉，無咎，孚乃利用禴。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"萃如，嗟如，無攸利，往無咎，小吝。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"大吉，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"萃有位，無咎。匪孚，元永貞，悔亡。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"賫咨涕洟，無咎。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"011000"},{"number":46,"name":"升","chineseName":"升","pinyin":"shēng","upperTrigram":"THE RECEPTIVE","lowerTrigram":"THE GENTLE","judgment":"元亨，用見大人，勿恤，南征吉。","image":"地中生木，升；君子以順德，積小以高大。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"允升，大吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"孚乃利用禴，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"升虛邑。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"王用亨於岐山，吉無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"貞吉，升階。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"冥升，利於不息之貞。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"000110"},{"number":47,"name":"困","chineseName":"困","pinyin":"kùn","upperTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","lowerTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","judgment":"亨，貞，大人吉，無咎，有言不信。","image":"澤無水，困；君子以致命遂誌。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"臀困於株木，入於幽谷，三歲不覿。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"困於酒食，朱紱方來，利用享祀，征兇，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"困於石，據於蒺藜，入於其宮，不見其妻，兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"來徐徐，困於金車，吝，有終。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"劓刖，困於赤紱，乃徐有說，利用祭祀。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"困於葛藟，於臲卼，曰動悔。有悔，征吉。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"011010"},{"number":48,"name":"井","chineseName":"井","pinyin":"jǐng","upperTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","lowerTrigram":"THE GENTLE","judgment":"改邑不改井，無喪無得，往來井井。汔至，亦未繘井，羸其瓶，兇。","image":"木上有水，井；君子以勞民勸相。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"井泥不食，舊井無禽。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"井谷射鮒，甕敝漏。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"井渫不食，為我心惻，可用汲，王明，並受其福。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"井甃，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"井冽，寒泉食。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"井收勿幕，有孚元吉。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"010110"},{"number":49,"name":"革","chineseName":"革","pinyin":"gé","upperTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","lowerTrigram":"THE CLINGING","judgment":"巳日乃孚，元亨利貞，悔亡。","image":"澤中有火，革；君子以治歷明時。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"鞏用黃牛之革。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"巳日乃革之，征吉，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"征兇，貞厲，革言三就，有孚。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"悔亡，有孚改命，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"大人虎變，未占有孚。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"君子豹變，小人革面，征兇，居貞吉。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"011101"},{"number":50,"name":"鼎","chineseName":"鼎","pinyin":"dǐng","upperTrigram":"THE CLINGING","lowerTrigram":"THE GENTLE","judgment":"元吉，亨。","image":"木上有火，鼎；君子以正位凝命。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"鼎顛趾，利出否，得妾以其子，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"鼎有實，我仇有疾，不我能即，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"鼎耳革，其行塞，雉膏不食，方雨虧悔，終吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"鼎折足，覆公餗，其形渥，兇。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"鼎黃耳，金鉉，利貞。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"鼎玉鉉，大吉，無不利。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"101110"},{"number":51,"name":"震","chineseName":"震","pinyin":"zhèn","upperTrigram":"THE AROUSING","lowerTrigram":"THE AROUSING","judgment":"亨。震來虩虩，笑言啞啞。震驚百裏，不喪匕鬯。","image":"虩雷，震；君子以恐懼修身。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"震來虩虩，後笑言啞啞，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"震來厲，億喪貝，躋於九陵，勿逐，七日得。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"震蘇蘇，震行無眚。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"震遂泥。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"震往來厲，億無喪，有事。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"震索索，視矍矍，征兇。震不於其躬，於其鄰，無咎。婚媾有言。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"001001"},{"number":52,"name":"艮","chineseName":"艮","pinyin":"gèn","upperTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","lowerTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","judgment":"艮其背，不獲其身，行其庭，不見其人，無咎。","image":"兼山，艮；君子以思不出其位。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"艮其趾，無咎，利永貞。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"艮其腓，不拯其隨，其心不快。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"艮其限，列其夤，厲薰心。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"艮其身，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"艮其輔，言有序，悔亡。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"敦艮，吉。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"100100"},{"number":53,"name":"漸","chineseName":"漸","pinyin":"jiàn","upperTrigram":"THE GENTLE","lowerTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","judgment":"女歸吉，利貞。","image":"山上有木，漸；君子以居賢德，善俗。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"鴻漸於幹，小子厲，有言，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"鴻漸於磐，飲食衎衎，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"鴻漸於陸，夫征不復，婦孕不育，兇；利禦寇。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"鴻漸於木，或得其桷，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"鴻漸於陵，婦三歲不孕，終莫之勝，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"鴻漸於陸，其羽可用為儀，吉。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"110100"},{"number":54,"name":"歸妹","chineseName":"歸妹","pinyin":"guīmèi","upperTrigram":"THE AROUSING","lowerTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","judgment":"征兇，無攸利。","image":"澤上有雷，歸妹；君子以永終知敝。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"歸妹以娣，跛能履，征吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"眇能視，利幽人之貞。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"歸妹以須，反歸以娣。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"歸妹愆期，遲歸有時。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"帝乙歸妹，其君之袂，不如其娣之袂良，月幾望，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"女承筐無實，士刲羊無血，無攸利。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"001011"},{"number":55,"name":"豐","chineseName":"豐","pinyin":"fēng","upperTrigram":"THE AROUSING","lowerTrigram":"THE CLINGING","judgment":"亨，王假之，勿憂，宜日中。","image":"雷電皆至，豐；君子以折獄致刑。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"遇其配主，雖旬無咎，往有尚。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"豐其蔀，日中見鬥，往得疑疾，有孚發若，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"豐其沛，日中見沫，折其右肱，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"豐其蔀，日中見鬥，遇其夷主，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"來章，有慶譽，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"豐其屋，蔀其家，闚其戶，闃其無人，三歲不覿，兇。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"001101"},{"number":56,"name":"旅","chineseName":"旅","pinyin":"lǚ","upperTrigram":"THE CLINGING","lowerTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","judgment":"小亨，旅貞吉。","image":"山上有火，旅；君子以明慎用刑，而不留獄。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"旅瑣瑣，斯其所取災。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"旅即次，懷其資，得童仆貞。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"旅焚其次，喪其童仆，貞厲。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"旅於處，得其資斧，我心不快。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"射雉一矢亡，終以譽命。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"鳥焚其巢，旅人先笑後號啕。喪牛於易，兇。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"101100"},{"number":57,"name":"巽","chineseName":"巽","pinyin":"xùn","upperTrigram":"THE GENTLE","lowerTrigram":"THE GENTLE","judgment":"小亨，利攸往，利見大人。","image":"隨風，巽；君子以申命行事。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"進退，利武人之貞。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"巽在床下，用史巫紛若，吉，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"頻巽，吝。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"悔亡，田獲三品。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"貞吉悔亡，無不利。無初有終，先庚三日，後庚三日，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"巽在床下，喪其資斧，貞兇。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"110110"},{"number":58,"name":"兌","chineseName":"兌","pinyin":"duì","upperTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","lowerTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","judgment":"亨，利貞。","image":"麗澤，兌；君子以朋友講習。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"和兌，吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"孚兌，吉，悔亡。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"來兌，兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"商兌，未寧，介疾有喜。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"孚於剝，有厲。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"引兌。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"011011"},{"number":59,"name":"渙","chineseName":"渙","pinyin":"huàn","upperTrigram":"THE GENTLE","lowerTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","judgment":"亨。王假有廟，利涉大川，利貞。","image":"風行水上，渙；先王以享於帝立廟。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"用拯馬壯，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"渙奔其機，悔亡。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"渙其躬，無悔。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"渙其群，元吉。渙有丘，匪夷所思。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"渙汗其大號，渙王居，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"渙其血，去逖出，無咎。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"110010"},{"number":60,"name":"節","chineseName":"節","pinyin":"jié","upperTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","lowerTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","judgment":"亨。苦節，不可貞。","image":"澤上有水，節；君子以制數度，議德行。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"不出戶庭，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"不出門庭，兇。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"不節若，則嗟若，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"安節，亨。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"甘節，吉；往有尚。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"苦節，貞兇，悔亡。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"010011"},{"number":61,"name":"中孚","chineseName":"中孚","pinyin":"zhōngfú","upperTrigram":"THE GENTLE","lowerTrigram":"THE JOYOUS","judgment":"豚魚吉，利涉大川，利貞。","image":"澤上有風，中孚；君子以議獄緩死。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"虞吉，有它不燕。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"鳴鶴在陰，其子和之，我有好爵，吾與爾靡之。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"得敵，或鼓或罷，或泣或歌。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"月幾望，馬匹亡，無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"有孚攣如，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"翰音登於天，貞兇。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"110011"},{"number":62,"name":"小過","chineseName":"小過","pinyin":"xiǎoguò","upperTrigram":"THE AROUSING","lowerTrigram":"KEEPING STILL","judgment":"亨，利貞，可小事，不可大事。飛鳥遺之音，不宜上，宜下，大吉。","image":"山上有雷，小過；君子以行過乎恭，喪過乎哀，用過乎儉。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"飛鳥以兇。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"過其祖，遇其妣；不及其君，遇其臣；無咎。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"弗過防之，從或戕之，兇。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"無咎，弗過遇之。往厲必戒，勿用永貞。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"密雲不雨，自我西郊，公弋取彼在穴。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"弗遇過之，飛鳥離之，兇，是謂災眚。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"001100"},{"number":63,"name":"既濟","chineseName":"既濟","pinyin":"jìjì","upperTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","lowerTrigram":"THE CLINGING","judgment":"亨，小利貞，初吉終亂。","image":"水在火上，既濟；君子以思患而預防之。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"曳其輪，濡其尾，無咎。","type":"yang"},{"position":2,"text":"婦喪其茀，勿逐，七日得。","type":"yin"},{"position":3,"text":"高宗伐鬼方，三年克之，小人勿用。","type":"yang"},{"position":4,"text":"繻有衣袽，終日戒。","type":"yin"},{"position":5,"text":"東鄰殺牛，不如西鄰之禴祭，實受其福。","type":"yang"},{"position":6,"text":"濡其首，厲。","type":"yin"}],"binaryTopFirst":"010101"},{"number":64,"name":"未濟","chineseName":"未濟","pinyin":"wèijì","upperTrigram":"THE CLINGING","lowerTrigram":"THE ABYSMAL","judgment":"亨，小狐汔濟，濡其尾，無攸利。","image":"火在水上，未濟；君子以慎辨物居方。","lines":[{"position":1,"text":"濡其尾，吝。","type":"yin"},{"position":2,"text":"曳其輪，貞吉。","type":"yang"},{"position":3,"text":"未濟，征兇，利涉大川。","type":"yin"},{"position":4,"text":"貞吉，悔亡，震用伐鬼方，三年有賞於大國。","type":"yang"},{"position":5,"text":"貞吉，無悔，君子之光，有孚，吉。","type":"yin"},{"position":6,"text":"有孚於飲酒，無咎，濡其首，有孚失是。","type":"yang"}],"binaryTopFirst":"101010"}]}